arentNotificationService');\n\nconsole.log('📱 Testing SMS services...');\nconsole.log('✅ SMS service loaded successfully!');\nconsole.log('✅ Parent notification service loaded successfully!');\nconsole.log('🎯 SMS system is ready for use!');\n\"\nif %errorlevel% neq 0 (\n    echo ❌ SMS service test failed!\n    pause\n    exit /b 1\n)\necho ✅ SMS services tested successfully!\n\necho.\necho [5/5] Restarting backend server...\necho Stopping any existing server...\ntaskkill /f /im node.exe 2>nul\necho Starting server in background...\nstart /b npm start\necho ✅ Server restarted!\n\ncd ..\n\necho.\necho ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\necho 🎉 PARENT LINKING SMS NOTIFICATION SYSTEM - SETUP COMPLETE!\necho ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\necho.\necho ✅ FEATURES ENABLED:\necho   • Rich SMS notifications for all parent linking scenarios\necho   • Automatic SMS when manual linking is performed\necho   • Comprehensive SMS when applications are approved/rejected\necho   • SMS logging and tracking system\necho   • Retry mechanism for failed SMS\necho   • Kinyarwanda language support\necho   • Multiple SMS provider support (Twilio, Africa's Talking, HTTP Gateway)\necho.\necho 📱 SMS SCENARIOS COVERED:\necho   • Application submitted → Parent gets confirmation SMS\necho   • Application approved → Parent gets detailed approval SMS\necho   • Application rejected → Parent gets rejection SMS with reason\necho   • Manual linking → Parent gets welcome SMS\necho   • Auto-linking → Parent gets account creation + welcome SMS\necho   • Conduct removal → All parents get detailed SMS\necho   • Leave approval → All parents get detailed SMS\necho.\necho 🔧 CONFIGURATION:\necho   • Configure SMS providers in backend/.env file\necho   • SMS messages are in Kinyarwanda with emojis\necho   • All SMS are logged in parent_notifications_log table\necho   • Failed SMS are queued for retry\necho.\necho 🚀 NEXT STEPS:\n